# Documentation site (docs-site/). The CLI reference and the Project documents pages (written from
# docs/) are generated at build time and never committed.
/docs-site/src/content/docs/reference/*
!/docs-site/src/content/docs/reference/index.md
/docs-site/src/content/docs/project/*
!/docs-site/src/content/docs/project/index.md
# Starlight build: installed packages, the built site, Astro's generated types and cache.
/docs-site/node_modules/
/docs-site/dist/
/docs-site/.astro/
